  "x-semantic-validation": ["Every Fraction is canonical reduced; denominator>0; bounded derived bits", "Leaf partition complete on normalized[0,1], interior disjoint, shared boundaries retained", "Nonpositive variation is terminal; DEPTH_LIMIT leaves width2^-96 and depth96", "Nodes=2*splits+1 and leaves=splits+1, with precharged work respected", "Exact supremum gap<=M_B*2^-96<=4*Cmax*2^-96 for model nonnegative B4", "Actual right-continuous endpoint included separately from left limit", "Whole-cell lower is a bound on the supremum, not a pointwise lower envelope", "Independent reference is Decimal160 guarded corroboration, with strict misses retained"]
